  "dst": "same-size bg canvas with marker bars extended and the periodic stripe mask projected across the full grid",
  "transform": "infer the source stripe period along the axis perpendicular to the marker bars; paint those whole rows or columns with the frame color, extend the marker bars across the canvas, and repaint source-color cells between the bars"
}
</annotation>
